by-nc/2.0/uk/</ext-link>) which permits unrestricted non-commercial use, distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original work is properly cited.</p></license></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p>We thank the scientists and scholars listed here who have given anonymously their time in order to make eCAM more rigorous. Your astute comments help to ensure an evidence base for eCAM. We have starred the names of referees who have reviewed five or more papers.</p><p>Abdollahi, M.</p><p>Abegaz, B.M.</p><p>Abo, Toru</p><p>Abolhassani, M.</p><p>Abu-Elmagd, Mohamed</p><p>Aburada, Masaki</p><p>Aburjai, T.</p><p>Adami, Silvano</p><p>Adams, James</p><p>Adams, Lynn</p><p>Adewale Adeneye, Adejuwon</p><p>Aggarwal, Bharat</p><p>Akbar, Sm</p><p>Alali, Feras</p><p>Ali, S.</p><p>Allouche, Yosra</p><p>Alvarez De Sotomayor, M.</p><p>Amagaya, Sakae</p><p>Amanlou, M.</p><p>Amira, O.</p><p>Anant, Shrikant*</p><p>Andrade-Cetto, A.</p><p>Appendino, Giovanni</p><p>Araki, Yoko</p><p>Armijo Olivo, Susan</p><p>Assis-Pandochi, Ana</p><p>Azaizeh, Hassan</p><p>Bae, Hyunsu</p><p>Bagya Raj D, Joseph</p><p>Banerjee, Sanjay</p><p>Bankova, Vassya*</p><p>Barea-Rodriguez, E.</p><p>Basaran, Nursen</p><p>Baskaran, Mani</p><p>Bastos, Jairo</p><p>Basu, S.</p><p>Baum, Linda</p><p>Bednarski, Patrick</p><p>Behari, J.</p><p>Bellavite, Paolo*</p><p>Belon, Philippe</p><p>Berkson, Burt</p><p>Bettendorff, L.</p><p>Bhat, Vinutha</p><p>Bhatnagar, Maheep</p><p>Bi, Kaishun</p><p>Bie, Xiaodong</p><p>Biedunkiewicz, B.</p><p>Bielory, L.</p><p>Bilto, Y.Y.</p><p>Birdee, Gurjeet</p><p>Bishop, Felicity</p><p>Bisti, Silvia</p><p>Biswas, Surjyo</p><p>Bocci, Velio</p><p>Bodeker, Gerry</p><p>Bodhankar, Subhash</p><p>Bonakdar, Robert</p><p>Bonatti, M.</p><p>Bonavida, Benjamin</p><p>Borckardt, Jeffery</p><p>Bosch, Peggy</p><p>Brands, Martien</p><p>Buttar, Harpal</p><p>Canter, Peter</p><p>Capasso, Raffaele</p><p>Capodice, Jillian</p><p>Caprilli, Simona</p><p>C&#x000e1;rdenas, Ren&#x000e9;</p><p>Carlson, Lin